cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Matchmaker in your research, please cite it as below, and cite ECCentric, whose measurements train it."
type: software
title: "qec-matchmaker: pick a decoder before you decode"
abstract: "Predicts from a noisy QEC circuit, without decoding it, whether it is above threshold, its logical error rate, each decoder's time per shot, and which decoder to use."
authors:
